      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the woman's thought process",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the woman's internal thought process, as expressed in the text 'i wonder if he's thinking about me siri.' This projection implies the user is identifying with the woman's perspective, imagining a romantic or emotional connection with the man, and using the meme to explore or mock this imagined scenario. The deictic 'me' in the text directly projects the user's self onto the woman's imagined self.",
