      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_2",
      "label": "User projected onto the man's search query",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the man's search query, 'find me interracial kinky amputee midget fisting porn.' This projection implies the user is identifying with the man's behavior, either by mocking or shamelessly adopting the degrading and offensive search query. The deictic 'me' in the search query (implied by the context) projects the user's self onto the man's imagined self, suggesting the user is either the target of the search or is identifying with the man's hypersexualized and degrading perspective.",
